WEBVTT

00:28:25.996 --> 00:28:32.954
more. Dramatic. More of a
staccato note than most,

00:28:33.746 --> 00:28:38.454
and I think we as a society need to figure
out how we're going to cushion

00:28:38.454 --> 00:28:41.996
everybody through that. I've got my
own ideas about how to do that.

00:28:41.996 --> 00:28:46.371
I, I wouldn't say that I have any reason
to believe they're the right ones,

00:28:46.954 --> 00:28:51.038
but doing nothing and not
really engaging with

00:28:51.038 --> 00:28:52.746
the magnitude of what's about to happen,

00:28:53.163 --> 00:28:55.788
I think it's like not an
acceptable answer.

00:28:56.246 --> 00:28:58.246
So there's going to be huge impact.

00:28:58.246 --> 00:29:00.704
It's difficult to predict where
it shows up the most.